Date: Thu, 26 Nov 2026 19:21:25 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] R' Yaakov Yisrael Posen (Q124715492): burial place, teachers
 and students from his grandchildren

Correction sent by the grandchildren in Otzaria/otzaria#4922:
- buried: the cemetery of the Ponevezh yeshiva (the Wikipedia/Wikidata value is kept as alt;
  the Wikipedia article is also in the category of people buried in the Ponevezh cemetery)
- teachers: his father R' Eliezer Posen, R' Chaim Greineman, R' Nissim Karelitz
- students: R' Nachum Gutentag, R' Avraham Attias, R' Shlomo Zalman Grossman

None of the repository's providers carries these facts, so the claims cite editorial and the
review flags name the report. link_refs.py links R' Nissim Karelitz to Q2903929; the other
five names are unresolved (added to refs-unresolved.csv).
